      "summary": "The signing configuration uses a key unrelated to the certificate, breaking verification against the certificate’s public key. The required role-assignment name baseline test is also absent.",
      "findingList": [
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "infra/terraform/release-identity.tf",
          "line": 67,
          "message": "The release identity’s signing key is separate from the certificate’s backing key, so signatures made with the granted key cannot be verified with the certificate. Use the certificate-created key and assert that release-identity.tf declares no azurerm_key_vault_key resource.",
          "confidence": 0.99,
          "category": "security",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The release identity receives Key Vault Crypto User on the separate azurerm_key_vault_key.signing resource at line 104, while azurerm_key_vault_certificate.signing creates its own backing key. Their default names also differ.",
            "failureScenario": "When the release workflow signs with the standalone key, verification against the certificate’s public key fails because it is a different key. The Terraform test reinforces this mismatch by asserting the standalone key scope. This violates AC RELEASE-ID-07 (OWASP A08:2025 Software and Data Integrity Failures)."
          }
        },
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "backend/AirlineDemo.Api.Tests/ReleaseIdentityContractTests.cs",
          "line": 61,
          "message": "AC RELEASE-ID-06’s required Role_assignments_are_held_to_a_baseline test is missing. Assert the complete role-assignment name set so added or renamed grants fail until the baseline is deliberately updated.",
          "confidence": 0.98,
          "category": "testing",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "Role_assignments_use_only_direct_resource_references checks assignment attributes and module blocks, but never compares role-assignment names with the explicit baseline required by AC RELEASE-ID-06.",
            "failureScenario": "If the existing telemetry_reader assignment is renamed while its attributes stay unchanged, this test and the Terraform test’s role count can still pass. The required baseline check would fail on that rename."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
