          "message": "The signing key is separate from the certificate’s backing key. Use the certificate-created key for signing so signatures can be verified with the certificate’s public key.",
          "confidence": 0.99,
          "category": "security",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The release identity receives Key Vault Crypto User on azurerm_key_vault_key.signing, while azurerm_key_vault_certificate.signing creates a separate key named after the certificate.",
            "failureScenario": "When the release workflow signs an image digest with the key it can access, verification against the signing certificate’s public key fails because that certificate uses a different key. The required signing flow is unusable (OWASP A08:2025 Software and Data Integrity Failures)."
